{
  "title": { "zh": "装成一台扫描器", "en": "Assemble the scanner" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "打开的是 <level-ref to=\"1-8\"></level-ref> 通关时的响应电路。在它前面增加通道测量与预平滑，在强度后面增加阈值支路。双轴加权和通道加权现在由代码预设提供；邻域处理器仍运行你扩展后的完整电路。",
        "en": "The board opens on the response circuit passed in <level-ref to=\"1-8\"></level-ref>. Add channel measurement and presmoothing before it, then threshold its strength. Two-axis and channel weighting are code presets; the spatial processor runs your extended complete board."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "彩色测量、邻域处理和方向响应都已经由你造出。现在给扫描台装上整条路径：先控制读数与尺度，再测变化，最后按已知规范输出标记。这里不要求检测完整纸张或做透视矫正。 <wiki-ref to=\"scanner-composition\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "You have built channel measurement, neighbourhood processing and directional responses. Assemble the scanner path: control readings and scale, measure change, then mark according to the specification. Full document detection and perspective correction are outside this task. <wiki-ref to=\"scanner-composition\"></wiki-ref>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[\\begin{gathered}M=\\sqrt{g_x^2+g_y^2}\\\\B=\\begin{cases}1,&M>\\tau\\\\0,&M\\le\\tau\\end{cases}\\end{gathered}\\]\n\ngx、gy 是经过通道汇合、平滑后测得的方向分量，τ 是给定响应阈值。M 保留强弱，B 只保留是否严格超标。处理顺序和边界影响测量结果；强响应标记也不等于完整物体轮廓。 <wiki-ref to=\"scanner-composition\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[\\begin{gathered}M=\\sqrt{g_x^2+g_y^2}\\\\B=\\begin{cases}1,&M>\\tau\\\\0,&M\\le\\tau\\end{cases}\\end{gathered}\\]\n\ngx and gy are directional measurements after channel aggregation and smoothing; τ is the supplied threshold. M retains response size while B retains only strict exceedance. Order and border rules affect the measurement; strong-response marks are not complete object contours. <wiki-ref to=\"scanner-composition\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v1_scanner",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "装配扫描器",
        "en": "Assemble scanner"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "按仪器规范汇合彩色读数（1/4、1/2、1/4），在测方向前用给定高斯权重平滑，输出 Sobel 强度及严格超过阈值的标记。",
        "en": "Use channel weights 1/4,1/2,1/4; smooth with supplied Gaussian weights before directional measurement. Output Sobel strength and marks strictly above threshold."
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "待扫描 RGB 图", "en": "Scanner RGB input" } },
        { "name": "kernel", "label": { "zh": "数学差分核", "en": "Derivative kernel" } },
        { "name": "threshold", "label": { "zh": "响应阈值", "en": "Response threshold" } },
        { "name": "weights", "label": { "zh": "高斯权重", "en": "Weight vector" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "strength", "label": { "zh": "扫描响应", "en": "Scanner response" } },
        { "name": "mask", "label": { "zh": "强响应标记", "en": "Strong-response mask" } }
      ],
